Package: slerp-qt-plugin
Source: slerp
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, slerp
Enhances: gwenview, dolphin
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Description: Qt image plugin that shows Slerp's textures and models
 Lets every Qt program that reads pictures open the files Slerp reads:
 Gwenview opens KTX2, KTX and ASTC textures and the other formats no Qt
 plugin reads, and Dolphin's Information panel and Gwenview show models,
 levels and materials slowly turning.  The plugin decodes and renders
 nothing itself: it asks Slerp's helper process, so no file parser or GPU
 driver runs inside those programs.  Programs load it when they start.
